+type: task
+title: "Add in-memory rental service"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implement the first in-memory rental module for the booking desk.
+
+The service will register boards and sails priced in euro cents, quote valid whole-day UTC periods,
+and create non-overlapping bookings. Cancellations are deliberately out of scope, while their
+future refund policy remains documented in the feature documentation.
